      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "3e595ef04d1af420aab35bbe014967d1024e3d86",
          "git_sha": "820d3d96d563fe83b5b41ef98a0bfd5845b9d343",
          "line_end": 98,
          "line_start": 91,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "onecli/onecli",
          "url": "https://github.com/onecli/onecli/blob/3e595ef04d1af420aab35bbe014967d1024e3d86/README.md#L91-L98"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_af1d51ead03b99baaa0608790bc763b267aa271444a0f0df5c65297bd8043bce"
      ],
      "text": "The platform comprises a Next.js web dashboard, an API server control plane owning the database and work queue, a Rust gateway, a runner, a sandbox supervisor, an SSH terminator, and a Slack channel adapter."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_d4b8cc091be8782a24b9a52609eb9151e9d46fb8f72a10f4309ec48af2f0334d",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "3e595ef04d1af420aab35bbe014967d1024e3d86",
          "git_sha": "820d3d96d563fe83b5b41ef98a0bfd5845b9d343",
          "line_end": 79,
          "line_start": 73,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "onecli/onecli",
          "url": "https://github.com/onecli/onecli/blob/3e595ef04d1af420aab35bbe014967d1024e3d86/README.md#L73-L79"
        },
        {
          "commit": "3e595ef04d1af420aab35bbe014967d1024e3d86",
          "git_sha": "820d3d96d563fe83b5b41ef98a0bfd5845b9d343",
          "line_end": 81,
          "line_start": 81,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "onecli/onecli",
          "url": "https://github.com/onecli/onecli/blob/3e595ef04d1af420aab35bbe014967d1024e3d86/README.md#L81-L81"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_13f7794cef82a3a5e04e480bbb06c04855a35e73beb13dc0573960f12db860a2",
        "slc_e2f94c7b4d8193f8fafb89d1f3944e93e5231596e12791d09b5c4af16d4166bf"
      ],
      "text": "Agents run in isolated sandboxes whose only network egress is the gateway, so they can reach only granted resources; the runner is outbound-only with no inbound ports, enabling NAT'd hosts without ingress or tunnels."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_1aafcecba604e3a6b3425e43d4e63cd4c4c1243a5eb977c0316f6985630d6282",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "tools-permissions",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "3e595ef04d1af420aab35bbe014967d1024e3d86",
          "git_sha": "820d3d96d563fe83b5b41ef98a0bfd5845b9d343",
          "line_end": 79,
          "line_start": 73,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "onecli/onecli",
          "url": "https://github.com/onecli/onecli/blob/3e595ef04d1af420aab35bbe014967d1024e3d86/README.md#L73-L79"
        },
        {
          "commit": "3e595ef04d1af420aab35bbe014967d1024e3d86",
          "git_sha": "820d3d96d563fe83b5b41ef98a0bfd5845b9d343",
          "line_end": 98,
          "line_start": 91,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "onecli/onecli",
          "url": "https://github.com/onecli/onecli/blob/3e595ef04d1af420aab35bbe014967d1024e3d86/README.md#L91-L98"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_13f7794cef82a3a5e04e480bbb06c04855a35e73beb13dc0573960f12db860a2",
        "slc_af1d51ead03b99baaa0608790bc763b267aa271444a0f0df5c65297bd8043bce"
      ],
      "text": "Credentials are never given to agents: the gateway injects them per request, matching secrets by host and path pattern into headers or query parameters, and agents authenticate with access tokens via Proxy-Authorization headers."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_6ca02f5aaf94f803bd4bf6f3575aeac290e2996dd83b1701b3738e7a52814922",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "memory-state",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "3e595ef04d1af420aab35bbe014967d1024e3d86",
          "git_sha": "820d3d96d563fe83b5b41ef98a0bfd5845b9d343",
          "line_end": 79,
          "line_start": 73,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "onecli/onecli",
          "url": "https://github.com/onecli/onecli/blob/3e595ef04d1af420aab35bbe014967d1024e3d86/README.md#L73-L79"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_13f7794cef82a3a5e04e480bbb06c04855a35e73beb13dc0573960f12db860a2"
      ],
      "text": "Agent memory is kept by the platform so it persists, and users can read and edit it at any time from the dashboard."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_9da261786b514d052e4c5b44818fc4aa5c68cd1cbac8420f9bbc3a0f702c68c6",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "3e595ef04d1af420aab35bbe014967d1024e3d86",
          "git_sha": "820d3d96d563fe83b5b41ef98a0bfd5845b9d343",
          "line_end": 98,
          "line_start": 91,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "onecli/onecli",
          "url": "https://github.com/onecli/onecli/blob/3e595ef04d1af420aab35bbe014967d1024e3d86/README.md#L91-L98"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_af1d51ead03b99baaa0608790bc763b267aa271444a0f0df5c65297bd8043bce"
      ],
      "text": "The runner starts, parks and reaps agent sandboxes, polls a work queue owned by the API server, and never touches the database directly."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_a686b8a5402d83443b13188e2d5f894af99a4e81e00d6e52cea6a5c4169312a2",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
