        "slc_89794f9da2b21ab6bcb875a679fdc90cd181e79c88f9ca2014b46fc46b69be0b"
      ],
      "text": "Repository development practice: local setup is `mise install`, `pnpm install`, `pnpm dev`, which generates .env secrets, starts PostgreSQL, applies migrations, and runs web, api, gateway and runner; `pnpm check` is the pre-push and CI gate and `pnpm test` runs test suites."
    },
    {
